File name: RBNKLOOP.MP
Path description: Rhudaur banking loop.
Path starts: Rhudaur bank.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 1
Level recommendation: 15-25
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: dark monk.
Additional information:

This loop, while barely being different from the default loop, is useful
because it makes banking your collected cash easy. When you use this loop,
set MegaMud to collect all gold, auto-deposit when you get over 500 coins
(make sure you have it set to do your banking at the Bank of Rhudaur)
and keep a minimum of 500 copper on hand. 
